  "created": "2026-11-09T20:20:50.633Z",
  "description": "An embeddable SQL database for .NET that builds its own fast access paths from the queries it runs, so there is no index to design. Tables are typed columns, held in memory or on disk, with ACID transactions over a write-ahead log, larger-than-memory paged storage whose every page is checksummed, and exact aggregates: integer sums are 128-bit and throw instead of wrapping. It is for applications that need dashboards, change feeds and analytics over their own data without running a database server, and it includes similarity search (NEAREST), NULL support, ClickBench-compatible analytic SQL, atomic change batches, and an EvalApp extension with async execution.",
  "id": "EvaluatedApplications.HoloDb",
